 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0
+
+- Discount codes: `applyCode` gives an order `SPRING10` (10 % off the items) or `WELCOME5` (5.00 € off items of
+  30.00 € or more). An order takes one code; a second code replaces the first. Shipping is still decided on the items
+  before the discount. Orders' totals show `discountCents`.
+
 ## 1.4.0
 
 - Orders keep the date they were placed on.
