 package holds the order book, in TypeScript; the shop's website and its staff tools use its public API from
 `src/index.ts`.
 
+An order may take one discount code at a time; `OrderBook.applyCode` gives it one, and a second code replaces the
+first. `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items, rounded to the nearest cent with a half cent rounding up. `WELCOME5` takes
+5.00 € off an order whose items come to 30.00 € or more. A discount never touches shipping, and whether an order ships
+free is decided on its items before the discount.
+
 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
